WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.680
for one minute straight through, and switch it up.

2
00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:04.960
Get those arms and legs going,

3
00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:08.040
snap those arms down, those legs together at the same time,

4
00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.000
then bring those legs apart

5
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:10.640
as those arms come up over your head.

6
00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:12.560
And you're trying to keep those arms relatively straight,

7
00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:14.440
keep that shoulder socket nice and contracted,

8
00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:15.900
keep those core muscles contracted,

9
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:17.420
those legs should be nice and solid,

10
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:20.400
all those muscles contracted to that thigh and that hamstring.

11
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.540
Just keep this motion going, nice, smooth, fluid motion,

12
00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:25.680
trying to keep it fast, bringing that heart rate up.

13
00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:26.880
You wanna be nice and warm,

14
00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.240
possibly even sweating by the time you're done.

15
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:55.560
And we're almost done, just 10 seconds left,

16
00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:56.840
keep pushing through it,

17
00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:58.440
keep those arms nice and straight,

18
00:00:58.440 --> 00:00:59.840
motion nice and controlled,

19
00:00:59.840 --> 00:01:00.960
we're almost there.
